{"$schema":"https://json.schemastore.org/sarif-2.1.0.json","runs":[{"artifacts":[{"contents":{"text":"<scxml xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2005/07/scxml\" version=\"1.0\" datamodel=\"ecmascript\" initial=\"a\">\n  <state id=\"a\">\n    <onentry>\n      <send event=\"ping\" eventexpr=\"'ping'\" delay=\"1s\" delayexpr=\"'2s'\"/>\n    </onentry>\n    <transition event=\"ping\" target=\"b\"/>\n  </state>\n  <final id=\"b\"/>\n</scxml>\n"},"location":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml014-send-conflicting-attributes.scx"},"mimeType":"application/scxml+xml"}],"columnKind":"utf16CodeUnits","properties":{"diagnosticCounts":{"errors":2,"notes":0,"total":2,"warnings":0},"producer":{"kind":"validator"}},"results":[{"fixes":[{"artifactChanges":[{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml014-send-conflicting-attributes.scx"},"replacements":[{"deletedRegion":{"byteLength":19,"byteOffset":152,"endColumn":44,"endLine":4,"startColumn":25,"startLine":4},"insertedContent":{"text":""}}]}],"description":{"text":"keep `event` and remove `eventexpr`"},"properties":{"applicability":"maybe-incorrect"}}],"level":"error","locations":[{"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml014-send-conflicting-attributes.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":25,"endLine":4,"startColumn":13,"startLine":4}}}],"message":{"markdown":"send event name cannot use both `event` and `eventexpr`\n\n**Note:** each `<send>` property (event, target, type, delay, and the send ID as `id` or `idlocation`) has one literal and one computed form; supplying both is ambiguous\n\n**Help:** keep exactly one of `event` or `eventexpr`\n\n**Spec:** SCXML 1.0 §6.2 <send>","text":"send event name cannot use both `event` and `eventexpr`"},"properties":{"byteSpan":{"end":152,"start":140},"category":"semantic"},"relatedLocations":[{"id":1,"message":{"text":"conflicting attribute"},"physicalLocation":{"artifactLocation":{"uri":"tests/ui/scxml014-send-conflicting-attributes.scx"},"region":{"endColumn":44,"endLine":4,"startColumn":26,"startLine":4}}